+0 of 41 are delivered as a public CLI surface, which is an explicit
+caller-integration bound (no `ax` command exists in this tree), not
+a gap in the assigned validation behavior. Process control, mesh
+transport, provider supervision, and backend operations belong to
+modeled callers and later leaves, which invoke these entries at
+every required boundary.
